<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>수학 공부 홈페이지</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg:        #07090f;
    --bg2:       #0d1017;
    --bg3:       #131720;
    --gold:      #c8a84b;
    --gold-dim:  #8a7235;
    --teal:      #2eb8a0;
    --teal-dim:  #1a6e60;
    --text:      #dcd7cc;
    --text-muted:#8a8578;
    --border:    #2a2d38;
    --border-gold: rgba(200,168,75,0.25);
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: "Palatino Linotype", "Book Antiqua", Palatino, Georgia, serif;
    line-height: 1.75;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ── MATH CANVAS BACKGROUND ────────────────────────────── */
  #canvas-bg {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.07;
  }

  /* ── NAV ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.1rem 3rem;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(7,9,15,0.95), transparent);
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }
  nav .logo {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  nav ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }
  nav a {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  nav a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

  /* ── WRAPPER ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .wrap {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  /* ── HERO ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  #hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 5rem;
  }
  .hero-inner { max-width: 680px; }

  .hero-tag {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--teal);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }
  .hero-tag::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 32px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--teal);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #f0ece0;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-bottom: 2.4rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .hero-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    border: 1px solid;
  }
  .btn-gold {
    color: var(--bg);
    background: var(--gold);
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }
  .btn-gold:hover { background: #dbbf60; }
  .btn-outline {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background: transparent;
    border-color: var(--border);
  }
  .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--gold-dim); color: var(--text); }

  .scroll-hint {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2.5rem;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    opacity: 0.5;
    animation: bobble 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .scroll-hint::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 1px;
    height: 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--text-muted), transparent);
  }
  @keyframes bobble {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(6px); }
  }

  /* ── SECTION COMMON ────────────────────────────────────── */
  section { padding: 6rem 0; }

  .sec-label {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #f0ece0;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .rule {
    width: 48px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--gold);
    margin: 1rem 0 2.8rem;
  }

  /* ── ABOUT ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about-text p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.97rem; }
  .about-text strong { color: var(--text); }

  .about-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }
  .stat-item {
    padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold-dim);
    background: var(--bg2);
  }
  .stat-item .stat-num {
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .stat-item .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }

  /* ── MATH TOPICS ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  #topics { background: var(--bg2); }

  .topics-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.4rem;
  }
  .topic-card {
    padding: 1.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .topic-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 3px; height: 100%;
    background: var(--card-accent, var(--gold));
  }
  .topic-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--card-accent, var(--gold-dim));
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  .topic-card .tc-symbol {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    color: var(--card-accent, var(--gold));
    opacity: 0.7;
    display: block;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .topic-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #f0ece0;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }
  .topic-card .tc-sub {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }
  .topic-card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .tc-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .tc-tag {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  /* ── NOTES / POSTS ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .notes-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .note-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr auto;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 1.15rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    transition: background 0.15s;
  }
  .note-item:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .note-item:hover { background: rgba(200,168,75,0.025); }

  .note-date {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .note-title {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }
  .note-title:hover { color: var(--gold); }
  .note-badge {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .note-badge.analysis  { border-color: rgba(200,168,75,0.4); color: var(--gold-dim); }
  .note-badge.algebra   { border-color: rgba(46,184,160,0.4); color: var(--teal-dim); }
  .note-badge.topology  { border-color: rgba(180,100,100,0.4); color: #9a5555; }
  .note-badge.geometry  { border-color: rgba(120,150,200,0.4); color: #6080aa; }
  .note-arrow {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  /* ── EQUATIONS SHOWCASE ─────────────────────────────────── */
  #equations { background: var(--bg2); }
  .eq-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.4rem;
  }
  .eq-card {
    padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .eq-card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; right: 0;
    width: 60px; height: 60px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(200,168,75,0.06), transparent);
  }
  .eq-name {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }
  .eq-display {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #e8e0c8;
    line-height: 1.9;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .eq-desc {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* ── GITHUB ACTIVITY ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .activity-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 3px;
    height: 48px;
  }
  .ab-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; }
  .ab-cell {
    width: 12px; height: 12px;
    background: var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .ab-cell.l1 { background: rgba(200,168,75,0.2); }
  .ab-cell.l2 { background: rgba(200,168,75,0.45); }
  .ab-cell.l3 { background: rgba(200,168,75,0.7); }
  .ab-cell.l4 { background: rgba(200,168,75,0.95); }

  .profile-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .profile-avatar {
    width: 80px; height: 80px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg3);
    border: 2px solid var(--gold-dim);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 2rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .profile-info h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 400; color: #f0ece0; }
  .profile-info .handle {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  .profile-info .bio {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  footer {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-align: center;
  }
  footer .f-sig {
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  }
  footer .f-quote {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
  }

  /* ── UTILITY ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .fadeup {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(18px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
  }
  .fadeup.visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    nav { padding: 1rem 1.2rem; }
    nav ul { gap: 1.5rem; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .eq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .note-item { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.3rem; }
    .note-arrow { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<canvas id="canvas-bg"></canvas>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a href="#" class="logo">∂ / ∂x</a>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="#topics">Topics</a></li>
    <li><a href="#notes">Notes</a></li>
    <li><a href="#equations">Equations</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="hero" style="position:relative;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-inner fadeup">
      <div class="hero-tag">수학 공부 일지</div>
      <h1>수학의 언어로<br><em>세계를 읽는다</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-desc">
        해석학, 대수학, 위상수학, 미분기하학—각각의 분야는 하나의 렌즈다.
        그 렌즈를 통해 보이는 구조들을 이곳에 기록한다.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-links">
        <a href="#notes" class="btn btn-gold">공부 노트 보기</a>
        <a href="https://github.com" class="btn btn-outline">GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint">scroll</div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-label">About</div>
    <h2>공부하는 이유</h2>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <div class="about-grid fadeup">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>수학은 정밀한 언어다. 그 언어를 익히는 과정은 느리고, 때로는 막막하다. 하지만 어떤 증명의 마지막 줄이 완성되는 순간—혹은 두 분야 사이의 숨겨진 연결고리가 드러나는 순간—그 감각은 다른 것으로 대체되지 않는다.</p>
        <p>이 페이지는 그 과정의 흔적들을 모아두는 곳이다. 완성된 지식이 아니라, <strong>진행 중인 이해</strong>의 기록.</p>
        <p>현재는 해석학의 기초를 다지면서 대수학과 위상수학의 연결을 탐색하고 있다. 미분기하학은 그 다음 목적지다.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stats">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-num">∞</div>
          <div class="stat-label">공부할 내용</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-num">4</div>
          <div class="stat-label">현재 진행 중인 분야</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-num">ε-δ</div>
          <div class="stat-label">해석학의 핵심 언어</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-num">2025</div>
          <div class="stat-label">공부 시작 연도</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TOPICS -->
<section id="topics">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-label">Study Topics</div>
    <h2>공부하는 분야</h2>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <div class="topics-grid fadeup">

      <div class="topic-card" style="--card-accent: #c8a84b;">
        <span class="tc-symbol">ε-δ</span>
        <h3>실해석학</h3>
        <div class="tc-sub">Real Analysis</div>
        <p>수렴, 연속성, 미분가능성의 엄밀한 기초. ε-δ 논법이 직관을 언어로 번역하는 방식을 이해하는 중이다.</p>
        <div class="tc-tags">
          <span class="tc-tag">완비성 공리</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">르베그 적분</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">함수열</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="topic-card" style="--card-accent: #2eb8a0;">
        <span class="tc-symbol">G/N</span>
        <h3>추상대수학</h3>
        <div class="tc-sub">Abstract Algebra</div>
        <p>군, 환, 체의 구조론. 갈루아 이론에서 군론과 체론이 만나는 지점이 이 분야의 절정이다.</p>
        <div class="tc-tags">
          <span class="tc-tag">군 동형정리</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">환과 아이디얼</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">갈루아 이론</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="topic-card" style="--card-accent: #b46464;">
        <span class="tc-symbol">τ</span>
        <h3>위상수학</h3>
        <div class="tc-sub">Topology</div>
        <p>연속성의 본질을 거리 없이 다루는 방법. 콤팩트성과 연결성이 분석학과 어떻게 연결되는지 탐색 중.</p>
        <div class="tc-tags">
          <span class="tc-tag">위상 공간</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">컴팩트성</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">기본군</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="topic-card" style="--card-accent: #6080aa;">
        <span class="tc-symbol">∇</span>
        <h3>미분기하학</h3>
        <div class="tc-sub">Differential Geometry</div>
        <p>곡면의 내재적 구조. 가우스 곡률과 가우스-보네 정리가 위상과 기하를 이어주는 아름다운 예시.</p>
        <div class="tc-tags">
          <span class="tc-tag">곡선과 곡면</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">리만 계량</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">가우스-보네</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="topic-card" style="--card-accent: #8a70c0;">
        <span class="tc-symbol">λ</span>
        <h3>선형대수학</h3>
        <div class="tc-sub">Linear Algebra</div>
        <p>고유값과 스펙트럼 분해가 모든 방향으로 연결된다. 함수해석학으로 가기 위한 언어적 기반.</p>
        <div class="tc-tags">
          <span class="tc-tag">스펙트럼 정리</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">선형 변환</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">내적 공간</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="topic-card" style="--card-accent: #5c9e6e;">
        <span class="tc-symbol">∫</span>
        <h3>복소해석학</h3>
        <div class="tc-sub">Complex Analysis</div>
        <p>코시 적분 정리와 유수 정리. 실수 적분 계산보다, 해석 연속과 리만 곡면으로 향하는 문이 흥미롭다.</p>
        <div class="tc-tags">
          <span class="tc-tag">정칙 함수</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">유수 정리</span>
          <span class="tc-tag">리만 곡면</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- NOTES -->
<section id="notes">
  <div class="wrap">
